{"id":"622019","name":"香菇虾仁焖饭","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/622019/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青虾","amount":"20个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"4朵"},{"name":"大米","amount":"1碗"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"郫县豆瓣","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：胡萝卜、香菇、青虾、大米。","img":"images/622019/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青虾去虾线。","img":"images/622019/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净后下锅烧水加盐加料酒焯烫。","img":"images/622019/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出后切段。","img":"images/622019/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"香菇胡萝卜洗净后切丁。","img":"images/622019/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大米放入电饭煲内胆洗净后加入适量的清水。","img":"images/622019/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备葱花。","img":"images/622019/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"葱花放入碗中再加入2勺生抽。","img":"images/622019/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅烧油。","img":"images/622019/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入香菇丁、胡萝卜丁翻炒。","img":"images/622019/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入食盐。","img":"images/622019/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入郫县豆瓣酱。","img":"images/622019/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/622019/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"准备葱花。","img":"images/622019/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"调酱汁：将葱花装入碗中放入2勺生抽。","img":"images/622019/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"将炒熟的香菇虾仁倒入电饭煲内胆中。","img":"images/622019/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"再倒入酱汁。","img":"images/622019/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"预约时间40分钟，按下煮饭键。","img":"images/622019/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/622019/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}